compagnia passino il giorno di Natale in teatro, impegnati nelle prove. Neppure la costumista e amica d'infanzia di Eden, Catherine, riesce a convincerla a non essere così egoista e capricciosa. Toccherà a tre insoliti spiritelli condurre Eden in un viaggio fantastico che le farà scoprire il vero spirito del Natale e la gioia di dare.”"},{"language":"en-US","overview":"On Christmas Eve, Kelly is reluctant to go to a Christmas Eve ball, so Barbie tells her the story of Eden Starling, a glamorous singing diva in the Victorian England and the owner of a theatre house. However, Eden is self-centered and loves only herself. She is frequently accompanied by her snooty cat, Chuzzlewit. She does not believe in Christmas and orders all her employees to work on Christmas.","tagline":"A Family Classic Filled With Laughs!"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/emExNDLQbOgHtSRSMgNGxREEmaE.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vYjZEw6g76pDXSoXTwtypr42Iyz.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":13459,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"en-US","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/emExNDLQbOgHtSRSMgNGxREEmaE.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/emExNDLQbOgHtSRSMgNGxREEmaE.jpg","language":"it","width":1175,"height":1763},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/emExNDLQbOgHtSRSMgNGxREEmaE.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/emExNDLQbOgHtSRSMgNGxREEmaE.jpg","language":"it","width":1175,"height":1763}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fX9g1AE1JIqjX3LPPKVjcmHs6fd.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fX9g1AE1JIqjX3LPPKVjcmHs6fd.jpg","language":"en","width":1400,"height":2100},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/